    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2P1JQ9UqE1vsw1UwgGCi9aM)_\n\nFollows #235. The `:devonthink` column now shows each link as `x` and its header is `DT`, so the column is narrow.\n\nTested in Emacs 29.3 batch (19 tests) and the tangle check; not run against a real DEVONthink.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8q9zwVhMybYWXqYXq)_",
